# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# The stock MiuiCamera YuvProcessor thread queries statfs() on its dma-buf
# backed capture buffer while saving a still image. That pseudo filesystem
# carries no SELinux label, so the metadata query is denied to priv_app and
# shows up as:
#
#   avc: denied { getattr } for comm="YuvProcessor_Re" name="/"
#       dev="dmabuf" tcontext=u:object_r:unlabeled:s0 tclass=filesystem
#
# Only the metadata read is granted; no directory or data access is added.
# A permissive-mode comparison showed this denial is not the cause of the
# missing still-image watermark, so this rule only keeps the log clean and
# restores the query the stock app expects.
allow priv_app unlabeled:filesystem getattr;
